# Sound the Trumpets: "Counter target spell. If that spell's mana value was 2 or less, recruit." Bot2's Abrupt Decay (mana value 2) can't be countered, so the counter
# does nothing and Decay resolves, destroying Bot1's Mox Pearl; the Trumpets' second sentence does not depend on the first, so Bot1 still
# recruits: draws an Island, discards Mox Ruby and gets a Human Soldier token.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Sound the Trumpets
Mox Ruby
Island
Plains
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Abrupt Decay
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Abrupt Decay.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sound the Trumpets.Cast(Abrupt Decay)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Mox Ruby)

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Abrupt Decay
Bot1.Graveyard = Mox Pearl; Sound the Trumpets; Mox Ruby
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Plains
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire; Mox Sapphire; Human Soldier Token
